        en: { name: 'Metaxy Mas', description: 'A taverna in the village of Exo Gonia among vineyards, serving Santorini dishes: tomato fritters, fava and lamb.', tip: 'Order the domatokeftedes, tomato fritters, and fava with capers, with a bottle of local wine; sit on the terrace. Come in the evening with a booking; cards are accepted.' },
